// // Proposed simplified and requirement-complete schema for the Conference Manager Web App
// // This schema focuses on:
// // - Core conference scheduling (day/section/presentation) including breaks
// // - Presentation categories (tracks) and types (with duration rules)
// // - Abstract/presentation submissions and acceptance workflow
// // - Search by author/title/section/keyword
// // - Favorites for presentations
// // - Multiple organizers per conference
// //
// // Non-essential/phase-2 features (materials, notifications, reviews, etc.) are intentionally excluded
// // or can be added later to keep the MVP practical for a 2-week delivery.

